  "spec": "Computes SHA-256, SHA-1, MD5 and CRC32 of any dropped files or pasted text, on the device, in chunks so large files work.\nPaste an expected hash or a checksum list to see which file and algorithm match; files seen before show unchanged or changed since the date they were remembered.\nIt does not upload anything, does not scan folders recursively, and does not repair files.",
